widget repeats the small widget’s information, adding a birthday event; on the right the medium widget adds information about tomorrow’s events.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/a29b600e231c019ccc0fd855603ac1be/widgets-calendar-medium%402x.png","line":53,"embedded":true},{"title":"An image of the large Calendar widget, which has the same width as the medium widget, but a little more than twice the height. Like the medium widget, the large widget displays information about today on the left and information about tomorrow on the right. On both sides, the large version includes relevant time-of-day indicators.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/d2a3a81b0ccbc123bb61e12b7da6b1ed/widgets-calendar-large%402x.png","line":55,"embedded":true},{"title":"An image of the extra large Calendar widget, which is about twice the width of the large widget and a little shorter. The widget displays information about today and the following three days, including relevant time-of-day indicators in all four columns. The today column is a little wider than the columns for the other days.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/f2738320bf945e097a8d16f35ca8d9c1/widgets-calendar-extra-large%402x.png","line":57,"embedded":true},{"title":"An image of the extra large portrait Music widget, which has the same width as the large widget but is taller.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/4ff038f07eaedfa7579dfa7e0ef38099/widgets-music-extra-large-portrait%402x.png","line":59,"embedded":true},{"title":"Accessory widgets","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/widgets#Accessory-widgets","line":71},{"title":"An image of the circular accessory Calendar widget, showing only the time for the next event.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/8f496e2dce59da3b8607cb07e4c4215c/widgets-accessory-calendar-circular%402x.png","line":82,"embedded":true},{"title":"An image of the corner accessory Calendar widget. It displays the time and title of an upcoming meeting.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/ee66466be7aa2d47efc551196156b8fa/widgets-accessory-corner-widget-watch%402x.png","line":84,"embedded":true},{"title":"An image of the inline accessory Calendar widget, showing the date and the number of the next events.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/b9af2a21096e381b9e3734e0119b7b09/widgets-accessory-calendar-inline%402x.png","line":86,"embedded":true},{"title":"An image of the rectangular accessory Calendar widget. It displays the time of two simultaneous events and their titles.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/8709b464372ab0810be34a951879ceec/widgets-accessory-calendar-rectangular%402x.png","line":88,"embedded":true},{"title":"Appearances","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/widgets#Appearances","line":99},{"title":"An image of the small Stocks widget on the Home Screen in the full-color appearance.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/c001f107005e17afb9e12d48d162dcb2/widgets-stocks-default%402x.png","line":110,"embedded":true},{"title":"An image of the small Stocks widget on the Home Screen in the clear appearance.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/ad7a87eea7f2be4863cf6a2e8d8a7639/widgets-stocks-clear%402x.png","line":112,"embedded":true},{"title":"An image of the small Stocks widget on the Home Screen in the tinted appearance.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/25e58f2c47d8b6d863187721d5c4abe9/widgets-stocks-tinted%402x.png","line":114,"embedded":true},{"title":"An image of the small Stocks widget on Apple Vision Pro.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/4b4e42b658c77b47c0f40d4d433d7b3b/widgets-stocks-visionos-frame%402x.png","line":121,"embedded":true},{"title":"An image of the small Stocks widget on the Lock Screen, showing the price of Apple stock.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/58aef111a6a92a03981f5998720bca48/widgets-stocks-ipad-lock-screen%402x.png","line":128,"embedded":true},{"title":"An image of the Stocks widget on the Lock Screen in StandBy, showing the price of Apple stock.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/cc1129210235e90f1ee9045eaf85dfb9/widgets-stocks-standby%402x.png","line":135,"embedded":true},{"title":"An image of the Stocks widget on the Lock Screen that uses the dark appearance in low-light conditions, showing the price of Apple stock.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/eb666a28d966abb92b34bdb0d14d8e0b/widgets-stocks-standby-night-mode%402x.png","line":137,"embedded":true},{"title":"A rectangular accessory Calendar widget on the Lock Screen of iPhone, displaying a team meeting at 4 P.M. in a conference room.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/1bf7a8ed9890752d8aac424f5406e978/widgets-calendar-rectangular-ios%402x.png","line":154,"embedded":true},{"title":"A rectangular Calendar watch complication, displaying a team meeting at 4 P.M. in a conference room.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/817c517d1183f2d8a797d7b304cefab3/widgets-calendar-rectangular-watchos-complication%402x.png","line":156,"embedded":true},{"title":"A Calendar widget in the Smart Stack on Apple Watch. It displays a team meeting at 4 P.M. in a conference room.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/a2d56d27563c849f1a5bc6b24406c59d/widgets-calendar-rectangular-watchos-smart-stack%402x.png","line":158,"embedded":true},{"title":"rendering mode","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/widgets#Rendering-modes","line":160},{"title":"full color","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WidgetKit/WidgetRenderingMode/fullColor","line":162},{"title":"accented","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WidgetKit/WidgetRenderingMode/accented","line":164},{"title":"vibrant","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WidgetKit/WidgetRenderingMode/vibrant","line":166},{"title":"Rendering modes","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/widgets#Rendering-modes","line":181},{"title":"Preparing widgets for additional platforms, contexts, and appearances","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WidgetKit/Preparing-widgets-for-additional-contexts-and-appearances","line":181},{"title":"`WidgetRenderingMode`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WidgetKit/WidgetRenderingMode","line":181},{"title":"Best practices","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/widgets#Best-practices","line":183},{"title":"An image of a small Weather widget showing current conditions for Cupertino. In text, the widget displays a temperature of 70 degrees, the condition Sunny, and forecast high and low temperatures of 75 degrees and 59 degrees, respectively. The widget also displays a yellow sun symbol above the word Sunny and the filled-in location indicator to the right of the word Cupertino.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/6a3718b9d1eb04c89acbf3c32cf9101e/widgets-ios-weather-small%402x.png","line":187,"embedded":true},{"title":"Making a configurable widget","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WidgetKit/Making-a-Configurable-Widget","line":203},{"title":"Updating widget content","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/widgets#Updating-widget-content","line":209},{"title":"Keeping a widget up to date","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WidgetKit/Keeping-a-Widget-Up-To-Date","line":215},{"title":"Animating data updates in widgets and Live Activities","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WidgetKit/Animating-data-updates-in-widgets-and-live-activities","line":217},{"title":"Adding interactivity","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/widgets#Adding-interactivity","line":219},{"title":"An image of the large Reminders widget with a toggle for each task. None of the tasks is complete.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/71a7227a45af08e53dccfcc4b9d9ffe4/widgets-reminders-large-unselected%402x.png","line":223,"embedded":true},{"title":"An image of the large Reminders widget with a toggle for each task. The toggles for the first and third items in the list indicate that these tasks are complete.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/6d2286d6fb3ded274a98ce9c2108f59f/widgets-reminders-large-selected%402x.png","line":225,"embedded":true},{"title":"An image of a medium Stocks watchlist widget, listing two stock market indices and one stock symbol. Each row displays the index or symbol name on the left, a graph section in the middle, and a current quote, including a value change, on the right.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/bfe482d5903ff332d0027450f18a6a43/widgets-stocks-medium%402x.png","line":231,"embedded":true},{"title":"Choosing margins and padding","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/widgets#Choosing-margins-and-padding","line":235},{"title":"Specifications","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/widgets#Specifications","line":239},{"title":"Apple Design Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/resources/","line":239},{"title":"SwiftUI","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI","line":239},{"title":"`padding(_:_:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/View/padding\\(_:_:\\","line":241},{"title":"`ContainerRelativeShape`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/ContainerRelativeShape","line":243},{"title":"Displaying text in widgets","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/widgets#Displaying-text-in-widgets","line":245},{"title":"SF Symbols","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sf-symbols","line":247},{"title":"Typography","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/typography","line":247},{"title":"Supporting Dynamic Type","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/typography#Supporting-Dynamic-Type","line":255},{"title":"`Font`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/Font","line":255},{"title":"`custom(_:size:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/Font/custom\\(_:size:\\","line":255},{"title":"Using color","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/widgets#Using-color","line":257},{"title":"Rendering modes","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/widgets#Rendering-modes","line":265},{"title":"Full-color","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/widgets#Full-color","line":267},{"title":"Dark Mode","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/dark-mode","line":269},{"title":"Supporting Dark Mode in your interface","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/UIKit/supporting-dark-mode-in-your-interface","line":269},{"title":"Asset management","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Xcode/asset-management","line":269},{"title":"An image of the small Notes widget. Below the yellow bar that contains the app icon and name, the widget displays a single note in black text on a white background.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/fe8bbb296cb8ad12a123b95562d7c1f5/widgets-notes-light-appearance%402x.png","line":271,"embedded":true},{"title":"An image of the small Notes widget. Below the yellow bar that contains the app icon and name, the widget displays a single note in white text on a black background.","target":"https://docs-assets.deve